lumn 6704`; printf '%s' -> the correct count), so pending_n is a parse-error STRING, not a number, and the 'if pending_n == 0 -> skip the PO spawn' short-circuit is comparing garbage. It did not fire this tick only because the idle rotation selected qa_drain, which JUMPs past Step 1. Independently re-confirmed here: this tick's own 18-envelope / 36162-byte inbox reproduces the same parse error under echo and reads 18 under printf '%s'. The same file also carries the VERDICT_JSON copy.\nAC-4 SHAPE (write it as a readback, not a narration): after the CLEAR write, re-read .dev_team_idle_chain.pending_triage_inbox and assert every consumed envelope_id is absent; fail loud if not. The current `|| true` swallows the abort, so removing `|| true` (AC-3) without adding this readback (AC-4) only converts a silent no-op into an unchecked one.")
  else . end
